{"id":"vod_zy360_70802","vodId":"70802","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"漆黑的子弹","name_cn":"漆黑的子弹","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"国产动漫","remarks":"全13集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20250115-1/dc9eb52689368384ef05a7420b92766e.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远的二零二零年，在同神秘生物“原肠动物”的战争中，人类首次尝到了彻底失败的滋味，土地被剥夺，权利被压榨，在冷酷的独裁统治之下，人类被迫过起了苟且偷生的压抑生活。然而，即便如此，坚强的人们仍然没有放弃反抗的机会，为了对抗强大的敌人，“天童民间警备公司”成立了。表面看来，里见莲太郎（梶裕贵配音）只是一介平凡的十六岁告众人，可实际上，他年纪轻轻就已经成为了“民警”中的一员，在搭档蓝原延珠（日高里菜配音）的帮助下，莲太郎决定要找到莫名死亡的父母的真正死因。一个绝密任务的出现将莲太郎带往了巨大谜团的中心，在危险和杀戮之中，他最终会得到怎样的真相？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-01-20 22:10:33","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/pLDrEQdb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/3dhvTzrl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/17Ouf1jL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/4YQ9D6Vr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/c4wqVgSU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/xquGxMDk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/FRr7bnMI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/oG775HMF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/rTO5Ji29/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/OwYML8S8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/vLyKD0pl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/P6dTFDrO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250113/BMxQ3vKR/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:48.346Z"}